' ADN QUIZZ - GUESS TITLE FROM MUSIC
' HYLST + TOMCHI HEAVY DEBUG
' affichage test clipp�,auto centre,font mono (avec possib de det couleur optimale visib) ou couleur, outline software possible
' So many strange errors
' Retropedalage, trop de bugs, rappel version de base
' Modifs faciles en cas de prob de contraste pour la police avec rc copy mode
' Checklist : UnPixelate, Scrambling, Fadeon/off, Sndh player renew, file loading, text display
$m 400000 ! memory need for the program 2 be compiled arrays & strings - OR RESERVE...
.
.
chk$="hello"
@hello
chk$="get_slide_filenames"
@get_slide_filenames
chk$="base_files_load"
@base_files_load
chk$="clearpal"
@clearpal
chk$="pmul160"
@pmul160 ! precalc 160*y&
chk$="prepfont"
@prepfont(FALSE) ! prepare font for display (4 colours or mono)
chk$="set_text_colors"
@set_text_colors ! pick ink/box colours from the intro picture palette
chk$="sndh"
@sndh(tune%)
chk$="screen.opening"
@screen.opening(pic%)
chk$="intro_quizz"
@intro_quizz
chk$="quizz"
@quizz
@bye
.
